    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract base class for different decay models. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="class_decay" kindref="compound">Decay</ref> models define how a quantity decreases over time. Subclasses implement specific decay laws, such as linear decay or no decay at all. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
